{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_057_1000_p", "source_sha256": "07b430d057ef918ebb8634fb30782dbd57a9250c257c8c12a947fc6c8c4aaf7b", "ja": "（さて……ふたりとも、ちゃんと待ってるかな？\nそろそろ、次の公演のことを伝えておかないと）", "zh": "（那么……不知道她们两个有没有好好等着呢？\n也差不多该告诉她们下一场公演的事了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_057_1001_011ami", "source_sha256": "15396798653e409e40ca1540894172b43e748e3b3bf49352bfc22bed5c40986f", "ja": "むむむむむ～！", "zh": "唔唔唔唔唔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_057_1002_012mam", "source_sha256": "15396798653e409e40ca1540894172b43e748e3b3bf49352bfc22bed5c40986f", "ja": "むむむむむ～！", "zh": "唔唔唔唔唔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_057_1003_p", "source_sha256": "93b1b81a4b59e2c715a75fd7b5ce037665953819d34a2bbf2483fc96837a77ee", "ja": "……いたいた。\n亜美、真美、ちょっと話があるんだけど。", "zh": "……在这在这。\n亚美、真美，我有话想跟你们说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_057_1004_012mam", "source_sha256": "943e1aeaffe9d091e8008c11214ec6969535e0f331eb95facff1393f763b33d8", "ja": "チーズだよ、絶対チーズ！　はいチーズ！\nほら、名前からして撮れ高も高そうっしょ！？", "zh": "是奶酪，绝对是奶酪！来，说“奶酪”！\n你看，光听名字就觉得肯定很上镜吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_057_1005_011ami", "source_sha256": "c4c3ed2284a7007855d8b842dbb33a7b0dd3eb9e0f6823c0f2654eab16a58176", "ja": "絶対ショートだよ、ショート～！\n奥が深いし、セカンドとかより肩が強そうだし～！", "zh": "绝对是游击手啦，游击手～！\n既有深度，又感觉肩膀比二垒手更强壮～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_057_1006_p", "source_sha256": "376cc0470dbd6d98550e35bd53918a15669e9558aaf50c973f7f0ee0d6f02ba3", "ja": "……話は聞いてもらえそうにないな。\nふたりとも、何で揉めてるんだ？", "zh": "……看来是不会听我说话了。\n你们两个，到底在争什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_057_1007_011ami", "source_sha256": "96be49b3ca3580eaae1782eb4365d15dd473d53a8f3d0d8ff9e2651003eff317", "ja": "ねえ兄ちゃん、どっちが好き！？", "zh": "我说大哥哥，你喜欢哪边！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_057_1008_012mam", "source_sha256": "96be49b3ca3580eaae1782eb4365d15dd473d53a8f3d0d8ff9e2651003eff317", "ja": "ねえ兄ちゃん、どっちが好き！？", "zh": "我说大哥哥，你喜欢哪边！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_057_1009_p", "source_sha256": "49c32ebe5a91018f47ccfadae888c0992c56a084da4f04eca3e8903d9979f94c", "ja": "ええっ！　そんな……ふたりはそっくりなのに、\n急に選べと言われても……！", "zh": "诶？！怎么会……明明两个人长得一模一样，\n突然让我选一个……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_057_1010_012mam", "source_sha256": "5a7bbee0638909468b6cabcfba565bb0b8dfe6b088eb89153a185a4c54971d35", "ja": "え、ゼンゼンそっくりじゃないっしょ？\nねえ兄ちゃん、チーズケーキが好きだよね？", "zh": "诶，完全不像吧？\n对吧，哥哥，你喜欢芝士蛋糕吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_057_1011_011ami", "source_sha256": "a2b5e1bbc8f2a703aa37ac5b008e85839d28bf0f4f2ff0a5f2008a53feeeb8c0", "ja": "違うよね、ショートケーキだよね？　ほら、\nなんか今日の兄ちゃん、イチゴが似合いそうだし！", "zh": "不对吧，是草莓蛋糕吧？你看，总觉得今天的哥哥特别适合草莓！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_057_1012_p", "source_sha256": "8b193ccb706c0eb57e5c2d2d4426b8b385559375e1f7a8addac9c66fdc3385d2", "ja": "……ああ、青羽さんの差し入れの話か。よかった……。\n確か、ミニケーキの詰め合わせだったよな。", "zh": "……啊，是在说青羽小姐送来的慰劳品啊。太好了……\n我记得是迷你蛋糕的拼盘来着吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_057_1013_p", "source_sha256": "5933d574f2c77dd9ce88340cb5427dfeb5b62c698833e7f39214082ace1102c2", "ja": "大丈夫、数には余裕があるから。俺の分は気にしないで\nふたりとも、好きなのを食べていいぞ。", "zh": "没关系，数量很充裕。不用在意我的份，\n你们两个挑喜欢的吃就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_057_1014_012mam", "source_sha256": "617346a655b43c27047f7550a5f9736b28bef240a3e3eed9818b2a457cc5cb1a", "ja": "えっ、好きなだけ？？", "zh": "诶，想吃多少都行？？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_057_1015_p", "source_sha256": "04d8b644c39d79b9ba6be12e158b1380f5f5ea2c9e7c96ff684f0d174fee1b34", "ja": "いや、好きなのを。", "zh": "不，是挑你喜欢的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_057_1016_011ami", "source_sha256": "df5c9ec6bbe2bbb25c8228ae001868d0e54793111aa87c015b93046747b6c630", "ja": "うん、わかった～。ありがと兄ちゃん♪\nところで、話ってなに？", "zh": "嗯，知道了～。谢谢大哥♪\n话说回来，找我们有什么事啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_057_1017_p", "source_sha256": "6671d332b3241cecce0f9295a26e9b719f089f7284195a3e81bab20ad04cb727", "ja": "やっぱり聞こえてたのか……実は、次の公演のセンター\nをふたりに頼みたいんだ。引き受けてくれるか？", "zh": "果然还是听到了吗……其实，我想拜托你们两个人担任下一场公演的中心位。愿意接下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_057_1018_012mam", "source_sha256": "0b51b7dac43c49b9ed75b9d56cdb5ba1d8a88b6fd52c154bb0c081d8687fd612", "ja": "おお！　えへへ、もちろんオッケーだよ～！\n真美たち、ずーっと出番を待ってたんだかんね！", "zh": "哦哦！嘿嘿，当然没问题啦～！\n真美她们可是一直在等着上场呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_057_1019_011ami", "source_sha256": "32527ac4c7deaaf135360f34b9fe724c3a72901995716d6ec547b5671b487d85", "ja": "ふっふっふ、腕が鳴るぜ！　腹も鳴るぜ！\nみさきちケーキ食べて、ひと暴れといきますか～！", "zh": "嘿嘿嘿，真是跃跃欲试啊！肚子也饿得咕咕叫啦！吃了美咲的蛋糕，然后大闹一场吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_057_1020_p", "source_sha256": "9b5dee076e62619f6dd52b63c356b6b0afe903e4e7a364f46f533e42494516cb", "ja": "よし、やる気はバッチリだな！　じゃあ、どんな\n公演にするか、早速ふたりで一緒に考えてみてくれ。", "zh": "好，干劲十足嘛！那么，演出要办成什么样，就赶紧和我一起想想吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_057_1021_012mam", "source_sha256": "e4aa049a87093b2fbde266e6a0282779641f2e682b0bf41c3c729f7ce552f388", "ja": "うん！　ふたりでメッチャ考えるね！\n……あり？　ふたりで？", "zh": "嗯！我们两个人会认真想的！\n……咦？两个人？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_057_1022_011ami", "source_sha256": "f9ba9998615ca6446d19ab0776ae624bb2b35012f8674afdb02f23ce2473daa7", "ja": "ちょっとタンマ。ねえ兄ちゃん、\nこれって亜美と真美、どっちがセンターなの？", "zh": "等一下。呐，哥哥，\n这里是亚美和真美，谁站C位啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_057_1023_p", "source_sha256": "5fe4863364947aaac94e8ff76c1b3458c683f6ddf1b0a81d2d42d7c01771be75", "ja": "え？　どっちがセンターって、それは……。\nどっちも、かな？", "zh": "诶？你问谁站C位？这个嘛……\n大概……两个都是？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_057_1024_011ami", "source_sha256": "116b9dadb6cd81ad6311613bd5be0422a295654ebf70473860c0c96524cd02b1", "ja": "うあうあ！　センターはひとりっしょ？\nはるるんがふたりいたらビックリするっしょ！？", "zh": "呜啊呜啊！C位不是只能有一个吗？\n要是有两个春香的话，会吓一跳的吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_057_1025_012mam", "source_sha256": "f88f2682d78e9cf3ef49c323ef1ef0ce5ad9f27ab5e21ddf1792139f394a412e", "ja": "こうなったら……亜美！\nとうとう決着をつける時が来たようだよ！！", "zh": "既然这样……亚美！\n终于到了决一胜负的时候了！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_057_1026_011ami", "source_sha256": "3331ed05c661600ce7b8ce7471b4928994aabb3529e2f9d1fc93629a97128d40", "ja": "フッ……そうだね、真美。白黒とか赤青とか、\nその辺ハッキリさせようじゃあないか！", "zh": "哼……是啊，真美。黑白也好，红蓝也好，\n就让我们把这些分清楚吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_057_1027_p", "source_sha256": "808e9552ab80192b46f7cd0b7c18e0d1d883f6f70e2b5f2faebad4fc8dab6357", "ja": "待て待て、落ち着いてくれ。ふたりには、\n仲良くセンターに立ってほしいんだけど……", "zh": "等等，你们冷静点。我本来是想让你们\n两个和和气气地一起站C位的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_057_1028_011ami", "source_sha256": "40d1c421bbb9164e31747ab7033623276f4c32607c6369c706c08f760cb94535", "ja": "兄ちゃんは黙ってて！！", "zh": "大哥哥安静点！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_057_1029_012mam", "source_sha256": "40d1c421bbb9164e31747ab7033623276f4c32607c6369c706c08f760cb94535", "ja": "兄ちゃんは黙ってて！！", "zh": "大哥哥安静点！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_057_1030_p", "source_sha256": "fafbb4720ad5efd303bd6599882130c262ab6cc4e6b4a9e4c727f49fee5d976a", "ja": "あ、ゴメン……いや、そういわれても！", "zh": "啊，抱歉……不过，你这么说我也很为难啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_057_1031_011ami", "source_sha256": "eeed71edb87f3559bef1237dc1c697e6d8a643bb95496f29d0a540ddf39d68f7", "ja": "てことで真美！　カクゴはいいね？\nてぶくろ、バーン！", "zh": "所以说，真美！做好觉悟了吧？\n手套——啪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_057_1032_012mam", "source_sha256": "dc2bb07ac8244a21118bb0582d8f416b9579312ab13db9ab536bbcf04902f07c", "ja": "もちろんだよ亜美！　ろくぶてパーン！\nかかってこいや～！！", "zh": "当然啦，亚美！反过来——啪！放马过来啊～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_057_1033_p", "source_sha256": "d2a903de065ab843acc9c9376d8cdfd00fc21b32ebdb3e6a265cb4eb9a070b80", "ja": "うわっ、待つんだふたりとも！\n争いは何も生まない……というか、ダメだからなー！", "zh": "哇，你们两个都等等！\n争斗是不会带来任何成果的……不对，反正不行就是了——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
